{"id":"ottuda","lemma":"оттуда","pos":"adv","rank":533,"glosses":["thence, from there"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/14/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%82%D1%82%D1%83%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%82%D1%82%D1%83%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Она вышла оттуда.","en":"She came out of there.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to exit, to go out","l":"выйти"},null]},{"text":"Она живёт далеко оттуда.","en":"She lives far from there.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to live","l":"жить"},{"g":"far off"},null]},{"text":"Мы хотели выбраться оттуда.","en":"We wanted to get out of there.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to get out"},null]},{"text":"Тебе меня оттуда видно?","en":"Can you see me from there?","words":[{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},{"g":"me","l":"я"},null,{"g":"it is visible"}]},{"text":"Выходи оттуда.","en":"Get out of there.","words":[{"g":"to go out","l":"выходить"},null]}]}